{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu02", "cards": [{"id": "u3.t.lysogenic-cycle", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">ly<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">so<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">GEN<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ic<\/span> <span class=\"st\">CY<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">cle<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"lysogenic cycle\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: lysogenic cycle\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"lysogenic cycle\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Viral<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">joins<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">host DNA<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Cell<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">divides,<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">copied<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Trigger:<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lytic<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">cycle<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A virus cycle in which viral DNA joins the host&#x27;s DNA and is copied quietly each time the cell divides.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>溶原周期<\/b>：病毒 DNA 整合进宿主 DNA，随细胞分裂被悄悄复制的循环。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">lyso + -genic = produces lysis later. Sleeping first, bursting later.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">先潜伏，后裂解。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does the host cell die right away in the lysogenic cycle?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. The viral DNA stays hidden and is copied as the cell divides.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.retrovirus", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">RET<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">vi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">rus<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"retrovirus\" data-audio=\"audio/retrovirus.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: retrovirus\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"retrovirus\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Viral<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">RNA<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Enzyme<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">copies<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">RNA into<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">joins<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">host DNA<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An RNA virus that copies its RNA into DNA, which joins the host&#x27;s DNA. HIV is one.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>逆转录病毒<\/b>：把自己的 RNA 反转录成 DNA 并整合进宿主 DNA 的 RNA 病毒，HIV 即是。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">retro = backwards. Information flows RNA back to DNA.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">retro = 向后：RNA 反向变成 DNA。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does a retrovirus make from its RNA?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">DNA.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.vaccine", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">vac<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CINE<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"vaccine\" data-audio=\"audio/vaccine.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: vaccine\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"vaccine\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Harmless<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">piece of<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">germ<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Body<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">makes<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">memory<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">cells<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Fast<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">defence<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">later<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A harmless piece or weakened form of a germ that trains the immune system to fight the real one.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>疫苗<\/b>：无害的病原体片段或减弱的病原体，用来训练免疫系统对抗真正的病原体。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">vacca = cow. The first vaccine used cowpox.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">vacca = 牛：第一支疫苗用的是牛痘。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does a vaccine give you the disease?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. It contains only a harmless piece or weakened germ.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.pathogen", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">PATH<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gen<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"pathogen\" data-audio=\"audio/pathogen.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: pathogen\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"pathogen\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"22\" width=\"90\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Pathogen<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">anything that<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">causes disease<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"22\" width=\"90\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Examples<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">flu virus, strep<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">bacteria, ringworm<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">fungus<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Any organism or virus that causes disease.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>病原体<\/b>：任何引起疾病的生物或病毒。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">patho = disease, -gen = producer.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">patho = 疾病，-gen = 产生。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name a bacterial pathogen.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Streptococcus (strep throat) or Salmonella, for example.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.antibiotic", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">an<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ti<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">bi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">OT<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ic<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"antibiotic\" data-audio=\"audio/antibiotic.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: antibiotic\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"antibiotic\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Works on<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">bacterial<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">infections<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"10.491071428571427\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Does not work on<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">viruses such as<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">colds and flu<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A medicine that kills bacteria or stops them growing. It does not work on viruses.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>抗生素<\/b>：杀死细菌或抑制其生长的药物，对病毒无效。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">anti = against, bio = life.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">anti = 对抗，bio = 生命。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Should you take an antibiotic for a cold?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. A cold is caused by a virus.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.cell-wall", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">CELL<\/span> <span class=\"st\">WALL<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"cell wall\" data-audio=\"audio/cell-wall.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: cell wall\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"cell wall\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"30\" class=\"f6 d\"/><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"65\" ry=\"26\" class=\"f3 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"21\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">cell wall (thick outline)<\/text><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"100.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"84.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,84.0 102.2,88.5 97.8,88.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A stiff outer layer that protects and shapes a cell, found in bacteria, archaea, plants and fungi.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>细胞壁<\/b>：位于细胞膜外的坚硬外层，保护并塑造细胞，见于细菌、古菌、植物和真菌。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">wall around a castle.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">像城墙。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Do animal cells have a cell wall?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.peptidoglycan", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">pep<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ti<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">do<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">GLY<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">can<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"peptidoglycan\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: peptidoglycan\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"peptidoglycan\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Bacteria<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">wall of<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">peptidoglycan<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Plants<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">wall of cellulose<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The mesh of sugars and amino acids that makes up the cell wall of most bacteria.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>肽聚糖<\/b>：构成大多数细菌细胞壁的糖与氨基酸网状结构。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pepti = protein bits, glycan = sugar. Protein + sugar = wall mesh.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">pepti = 蛋白质，glycan = 糖：蛋白质加糖。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which cell wall contains peptidoglycan: bacteria or plants?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Bacteria.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.nucleoid", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">NU<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">cle<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">oid<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"nucleoid\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: nucleoid\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"nucleoid\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"30\" class=\"f6 d\"/><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"65\" ry=\"26\" class=\"f3 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"21\" class=\"f1\"/><path d=\"M80 58 Q90 45 105 55 Q115 68 98 70 Q80 68 80 58\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">nucleoid: DNA, no membrane<\/text><line x1=\"95.0\" y1=\"100.0\" x2=\"95.0\" y2=\"72.0\"/><polygon points=\"95.0,72.0 97.2,76.5 92.8,76.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The region of a prokaryote where its circular DNA is found. It has no membrane.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>拟核<\/b>：原核细胞中存放环状 DNA 的区域，没有膜包裹。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">nucleoid = &quot;nucleus-like&quot;.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">nucleoid = 像核的区域。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does the nucleoid have a membrane?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u3.t.lysogenic-cycle", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A virus cycle in which viral DNA joins the host&#x27;s DNA and is copied quietly each time the cell divides.”<\/i>", "opts": ["methanogen", "extremophile", "lysogenic cycle", "plasmid"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>lysogenic cycle<\/b>: A virus cycle in which viral DNA joins the host&#x27;s DNA and is copied quietly each time the cell divides. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">溶原周期<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.retrovirus", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An RNA virus that copies its RNA into DNA, which joins the host&#x27;s DNA. HIV is one.”<\/i>", "opts": ["extremophile", "nucleoid", "retrovirus", "lysogenic cycle"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>retrovirus<\/b>: An RNA virus that copies its RNA into DNA, which joins the host&#x27;s DNA. HIV is one. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">逆转录病毒<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.vaccine", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A harmless piece or weakened form of a germ that trains the immune system to fight the real one.”<\/i>", "opts": ["biofilm", "bacteriophage", "pathogen", "vaccine"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>vaccine<\/b>: A harmless piece or weakened form of a germ that trains the immune system to fight the real one. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">疫苗<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.pathogen", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Any organism or virus that causes disease.”<\/i>", "opts": ["plasmid", "conjugation", "retrovirus", "pathogen"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>pathogen<\/b>: Any organism or virus that causes disease. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">病原体<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.antibiotic", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A medicine that kills bacteria or stops them growing. It does not work on viruses.”<\/i>", "opts": ["pilus", "bacteriophage", "antibiotic", "vaccine"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>antibiotic<\/b>: A medicine that kills bacteria or stops them growing. It does not work on viruses. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">抗生素<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.cell-wall", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A stiff outer layer that protects and shapes a cell, found in bacteria, archaea, plants and fungi.”<\/i>", "opts": ["lytic cycle", "endospore", "peptidoglycan", "cell wall"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>cell wall<\/b>: A stiff outer layer that protects and shapes a cell, found in bacteria, archaea, plants and fungi. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">细胞壁<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.peptidoglycan", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The mesh of sugars and amino acids that makes up the cell wall of most bacteria.”<\/i>", "opts": ["capsid", "peptidoglycan", "antibiotic", "cyanobacteria"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>peptidoglycan<\/b>: The mesh of sugars and amino acids that makes up the cell wall of most bacteria. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">肽聚糖<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.nucleoid", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The region of a prokaryote where its circular DNA is found. It has no membrane.”<\/i>", "opts": ["microorganism", "retrovirus", "nucleoid", "cyanobacteria"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>nucleoid<\/b>: The region of a prokaryote where its circular DNA is found. It has no membrane. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">拟核<\/span>", "whys": null}]}